---
import Layout from '~/components/Layout.astro';
import PageIntro from '~/components/PageIntro.astro';
import ValuesBlock from '~/components/ValuesBlock.astro';
import Prose from '~/components/Prose.astro';
---

<Layout title="Vision & Values · FRAM" description="The seven values that shape life at FRAM School: kindness, curiosity, awareness, leadership, fairness, resilience, respect." current="/about/values">
  <PageIntro
    eyebrow="Vision & values"
    title="To inspire meaningful learning, personal growth, and responsible citizenship."
    lead="FRAM is built around seven values, lived daily in classrooms, in the playground, in the way teachers and children speak to each other. They are the answer to the question: what kind of person do we hope a FRAM child will become?"
  />

  <ValuesBlock variant="sticker" />

  <section class="section--tight reading">
    <Prose>
      <h2>Four guiding principles</h2>
      <p>Underneath the seven values are four ideas about children we treat as foundational:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Each child is unique and needs empowerment.</li>
        <li>Children develop through positive relationships.</li>
        <li>Balanced learning requires genuine environments.</li>
        <li>Children progress at individual paces and directions.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>These shape how we plan a lesson, how we settle a disagreement in the playground, and how we talk to families when something is hard.</p>
    </Prose>
  </section>
</Layout>
